    "$t": "過肉粽節了後"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>劉淑娟</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過肉粽節了後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天氣隨變kah tsiok燒熱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">空氣中有一種無形ê低氣壓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">壓（ah）kah規个人tsiok bē爽快</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過肉粽節了後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">開始就ài開冷氣吹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做khang-khuè流汗規身軀tâm溼黏thi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吹規暝ê冷氣嚨喉疼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過肉粽節了後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">國會改革法案覆議（hok-gī）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">已經正式uì行政院送去立法院</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh有團體beh thuánn除「烏芯」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過肉粽節了後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám ē就熱到風颱天？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ǹg望一寡風一寡雨掃走燒氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">順suà掃走hia-ê　想beh賣台灣ê人</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiW9Qt1pIWHuAyiSdnfLcDU-e0O3mEysMk_2-5CyJ2KUtkoMu6qgIHBPrcgs4ReBu6iig5VqKEPGqB5Pw47NdzRmmATKUTVXZGoQTFGPBmzELcS5NoiY3xx4ykqNrdAe3C9BTRoCztztBThJW0WCSo82VQLNqH1PuyxVM6WqArvwmpGL-CKj55boxK7KJzO/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_08_b.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiW9Qt1pIWHuAyiSdnfLcDU-e0O3mEysMk_2-5CyJ2KUtkoMu6qgIHBPrcgs4ReBu6iig5VqKEPGqB5Pw47NdzRmmATKUTVXZGoQTFGPBmzELcS5NoiY3xx4ykqNrdAe3C9BTRoCztztBThJW0WCSo82VQLNqH1PuyxVM6WqArvwmpGL-CKj55boxK7KJzO/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_08_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicjoKQoD2fxbRXjMuj78wBxe9nBSalmSY559TxYmblhSvwsDZ8lze85vAzqMppxPICPY0Folh69uss6uKk5Sl1wAgdsdKwMrsBEANnCvhiRt-Agbz0YcKbJfDHIjG1BYNJJSOkFEWPDhJjMt-ecjg10CrDmSH6ndJ_19DhvQXwCBRyI6g7ErjraukShbVa/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_09_b.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicjoKQoD2fxbRXjMuj78wBxe9nBSalmSY559TxYmblhSvwsDZ8lze85vAzqMppxPICPY0Folh69uss6uKk5Sl1wAgdsdKwMrsBEANnCvhiRt-Agbz0YcKbJfDHIjG1BYNJJSOkFEWPDhJjMt-ecjg10CrDmSH6ndJ_19DhvQXwCBRyI6g7ErjraukShbVa/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_09_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: bo